---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us - Tap Tempo | ttaptempo.com"
  description="Learn about ttaptempo.com, our mission to build fast, free, client-side audio utilities with zero sign-ups and zero data tracking."
  canonicalPath="/about/"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-50 dark:bg-neutral-900 text-xs font-mono text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 mb-4">
      <span>Our Mission</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100 mb-6">
      About ttaptempo.com
    </h1>

    <div class="prose prose-neutral dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed space-y-6">
      <p class="text-lg">
        <strong>ttaptempo.com</strong> was engineered to solve a common frustration experienced by musicians, sound designers, audio engineers, DJs, and music students: existing online tap tempo tools were cluttered with distracting ads, required intrusive account creation, or lacked essential music production features.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100 mt-8 mb-3">Our Core Principles</h2>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 not-prose my-6">
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-50 dark:bg-neutral-900">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100 mb-1">100% Free &amp; Unlimited</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">No subscriptions, no premium tiers, no locked features. Every tool is completely open and free for creators worldwide.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-50 dark:bg-neutral-900">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100 mb-1">Zero Accounts Required</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">No passwords to remember, no email signups, no spam. Open the site and tap immediately.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-50 dark:bg-neutral-900">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100 mb-1">Private &amp; Client-Side</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">All timing math and Web Audio synthesizer calculations run directly inside your browser. No personal audio data is ever transmitted to a server.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-50 dark:bg-neutral-900">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100 mb-1">Sub-Millisecond Accuracy</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">Powered by the browser's High Resolution Time API for professional studio accuracy.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100 mt-8 mb-3">Who Is This Built For?</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-sm">
        <li><strong>Music Producers &amp; Beatmakers:</strong> Synchronize reverb pre-delay and delay plugin repeats to your track tempo.</li>
        <li><strong>DJs &amp; Performers:</strong> Quickly verify song tempo during transitions or live sets.</li>
        <li><strong>Instrumentalists (Guitar, Piano, Drums):</strong> Practice steady meter and rhythm timing.</li>
        <li><strong>Athletes &amp; Dancers:</strong> Determine musical pacing for choreographies, running cadences, and aerobics.</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="text-sm pt-4">
        Have questions or feedback? Feel free to reach out to our team at <a href="/contact/" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 underline underline-offset-4">our contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
